## Verification Note

All functionality has been replaced by `web/js/app.js` (plain JS SPA) and 
`web/css/styles.css` (brand tokens). The archived source is kept for reference 
only; the application runs without these files.

## To Revert (Not Recommended)

1. Install dependencies: `cd web && npm install`
2. Run build: `npm run build`
3. Start dev server: `npm run dev`
3. Application will use React Router and component-based rendering.

## Current Runtime (Without This Source)

The application runs successfully using:
- `web/index.html` - HTML entry point
- `web/js/app.js` - Vanilla JS SPA
- `web/css/styles.css` - Brand token styles

All routes, authentication, report flows, and map functionality work without
the React/TS source code.